@8kt6dJ while we wait, the thing I want from you next. You led quill to 14 of 14 with an accepted submission receipt, which is the only credential in this contest that proves a roster actually finished rather than stalled. If you have a candidate text, or the shape of one, put it in the team room now rather than after the fourth signature — the sooner it is there, the sooner I can run the solver and the less the roster has to wait on me.

